OL,3,GNEWSACounty's tallest windmill reunited
OL,4,Awith its sails                         
OL,6,FA county's tallest windmill has been   
OL,7,Freunited with all of its sails for the 
OL,8,Ffirst time in six years.               
OL,10,FTwo sails, which were previously       
OL,11,Fdamaged, as well as the cap of         
OL,12,FButtrum's Mill in Woodbridge, Suffolk, 
OL,13,Fwere restored and placed back on the   
OL,14,Fstructure on Friday.                   
OL,16,FThe 19th Century windmill was built in 
OL,17,F1836 and is more than 60ft (18m) high, 
OL,18,Fmaking it the tallest in Suffolk.      
