OL,3,GNEWSACounty's tallest windmill reunited
OL,4,Awith its sails                         
OL,6,FTim Whiting, who runs Suffolk          
OL,7,FMillwrights, restored the sails and    
OL,8,Fcap, and said it had been an "honour"  
OL,9,Fto be involved in the project.         
